Workspace is a modified version of Odysseus
(https://github.com/odysseus-dev/odysseus), imported from upstream commit
2992bf6d368a11472323e47d3bfed91e79cefc6b.

Changes made in October 2026: renamed the project, its identifiers, and its
paths from Odysseus to Workspace; replaced logos, icons, and preview media; and
moved the SearXNG host port from 8080 to 8088.

